**Summary:** No PR; this was a read-only diagnosis for B-031. The main cause is the pipe re-check after every pit (`PitCommand.cs:583` into `LinkService.Geometry.cs:937`): about 56 ms per pipe, so about 3 s per pit, with B-004's memo off on this path. The second cause is the once-per-drawing merge (`ProjectDataService.cs:664/772`, 10.1 s); the third is the same re-check after sources. The planned switch is `linking.pitRelinkReadsEachObjectOnce`, ON by default. The report is in `C:\CE_PLAN\areas`.
